            <title>[IGNITE-11868] GridClient#data() should be deprecated/removed.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11868</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It seems that &lt;tt&gt;GridClient#data()&lt;/tt&gt; does not make sense after &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3488&quot; title=&quot;Prohibit null as name in all the components (cache name first of all).&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-3488&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-3488&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and therefore it can be removed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
