                            <comment id="16929978" author="kcheng.mvp" created="Sun, 15 Sep 2019 14:15:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slava.koptilin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slava.koptilin&quot;&gt;slava.koptilin&lt;/a&gt; I noticed there are lots of tests use this method. Seems we can not simply remove this method, so can we just annotate it as deprecated?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16934340" author="slava.koptilin" created="Fri, 20 Sep 2019 12:19:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kcheng.mvp&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kcheng.mvp&quot;&gt;kcheng.mvp&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Well, this method is internal (it should not affect end-users) and therefore that its use can be reworked I think.&lt;br/&gt;
However, could you please list all tests that use this method? I could not find such tests.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16934463" author="kcheng.mvp" created="Fri, 20 Sep 2019 14:47:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slava.koptilin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slava.koptilin&quot;&gt;slava.koptilin&lt;/a&gt; my fault, there are references from unit test. i will try to remove this method. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
